cription":"Remote Play on Tablet"},{"id":43,"description":"Remote Play on TV"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"1658040","steamName":"I Am Future: Cozy Apocalypse Survival","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1658040/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T08:12:23.087381+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"I Am Future is a relaxing single-player survival game about building a cozy rooftop camp amid a flooded post-apocalyptic city. Set up a farm, go fishing, tinker with gadgets, craft new tools, manage a team of cute robots to automate and expand your base, explore the mysterious world, and chill out!","detailedDescription":"What if survival games were not stressful? What if the end of the world could be without all the doom and gloom? \n\nI Am Future invites you to build a rooftop base of your dreams, explore a mysterious world, start a farm, hire a team of cute robot minions, and make new friends, all while enjoying the chillest post-apocalypse ever.\n\n   \n\nStarting from scratch on an abandoned rooftop, build, decorate and expand the coziest camp ever! Unlock new buildings and furniture, set up electrical grids, and neatly organize your new life.\n\nYou are the last survivor on Earth, fresh from the sweet, long cryogenic sleep. It’s finally time to chill out and stop worrying about job tasks and inflation! Relax, build, wander around – the world is literally yours!\n\nNature is healing! Set up a farm, grow fruit, vegetables, cheese trees, and take care of your crops!\n\nPlay as Robin or Chris, and customize the protagonist to reflect your unique idea of the last person on Earth!\n\nFind ancient artifacts from a bygone era, such as kettles, TVs, or microwaves, take them apart using a satisfying dismantling mechanic, and gather resources for your next crafting project!\n\nAutomate chores around the camp with the help of cute robots! Build a team of AI assistants, issue commands, and manage their workload. And when they’re done – let them chill in a charging bath!\n\nSend out scouting drones on expeditions across the sunken megapolis. Discover new locations, bring something valuable back to the base, and, step by step, uncover the mystery behind the end of the world.\n\nCollect fresh produce from your farm, catch some fish, and unleash your inner chef with numerous delicious recipes ripe for mastering!\n\nThe fact you’re the last human on Earth does not mean you can’t still make new friends! Meet quirky robot inhabitants of this new world, like Earl the Fridge or Bombshell Barbara, and grow your bond with them.\n\nYour camp needs love and protection. Keep pesky mutant pests from destroying the crops or the electrical grid!\n\n***\n\nIf you are a fan of games like Stardew Valley, Coral Island, Sun Haven, My Time at Portia/Sandrock, Dave the Diver, or Palia, we are pretty sure I Am Future will become your next cozy adventure. Join our Discord to keep up with all things I Am Future!","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658040/bf45fa20a71ce86f97e6e47d0ad67fc81e94d69c/header.jpg?t=1781537508"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658040/72fa2358f4a1b52004635f6885fa2a824b4c75c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781537508"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658040/ss_0e475f6535c5642d8ad5d904c03da43ef1795965.600x338.jpg?t=1781537508","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658040/ss_0e475f6535c5642d8ad5d904c03da43ef1795965.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781537508"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658040/ss_35c930b61ae7eeaceff2461